        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Pemko Automatic Door Bottom Seal</b>\r\n<p>\r\nSemi-mortise and full surface automatic door bottom  seal kit. Smoother action positive seal mechanism. All Pemko automatic door bottoms consist of an aluminum case which surrounds a movable drop-bar seal. The drop-bar seal is actuated by a plunger which contacts the jamb as the door is closing, forcing the drop-bar seal down against the floor / threshold. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe gray nylon filaments conform extremely well to irregular surfaces such as carpet, stone and grout lines. Seal up to a 3/4\" gap under the door.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n Field sizable 2\" (you can only shorten it a total of 2 inches). Powder coated non-rusting aluminum blade housing. Packaged with installation screws.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Pemko 4301CNBL Automatic Door Bottom Seal\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1-25/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Housing Width: 29/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Door Gap to Floor: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Seal Color: Black</li>\r\n<li>Nylon Brush Color: Gray</li>\r\n<li>Handed, Reversible</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/4301NBL_install.pdf?v=1704262273\" target=\"new\"><b>Pemko 4301CNBL Installation</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPlease allow 10-14 days to ship. Made to order in any size ranging from 18\" to 72\". Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact Us</b></a> with your requirements.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
